Package: FederatedPs
Title: Propensity Score Checks with Cyclops Coordinate Descent
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Younwoo", "Ki", email = "dewonsunrise@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Prepares sparse propensity score inputs and compares local,
    pooled, and two-state coordinate descent in one R process. Reuses Cyclops
    calculation APIs and the data structure used by CohortMethod matching and
    covariate balance. A research DataSHIELD interface jointly updates persistent
    server states with synthetic inputs or explicitly enabled, protected local
    inputs. Coordinate fitting requires a separately patched Cyclops installation.
    Database extraction is a separate research driver; clinical outcome analysis
    is not provided.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
